# The photos are served by the R2 bucket itself (its public address), not through the API:
# a photo is <VITE_PHOTO_ORIGIN>/images/<photo id>. Leave this out to fetch every photo through /api/images/<id>.
#
# This is the bucket's r2.dev development address: it is rate-limited and not meant for production.
# Replace it with a custom domain (https://photos.yourdomain.com) when you have one.
VITE_PHOTO_ORIGIN=https://pub-5c7ce8417902430eb3d584b8dd2a2f83.r2.dev
